  "ingredients": [
    "0.25 cup olive oil",
    "2 large onions, diced",
    "0.33333334326744 cup curry powder, or to taste",
    "6 skinless, boneless chicken breast halves - cut into strips"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/CitCXsH0m4iQePP1qHk2Ix3Hbps=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/15156-Easy-Chicken-Curry-ddmds-4x3-step-01-f432e4ba74fc46f1b0adc3cf4dd320e5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15156/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat oil in a large skillet over medium heat until hot. Add onion and sauté until soft and golden brown, 5 to 8 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/07an8N2RzsK4-BGAdKNfNNjJp2Q=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/15156-Easy-Chicken-Curry-ddmds-4x3-step-02-8ff763001ef94765ac2bc3363291d36c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15156/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Slowly stir in curry powder until well blended.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/l5t0ZtOwYNrvCO3Kf62fGS7Q00c=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/15156-Easy-Chicken-Curry-ddmds-4x3-step-03-1eff703f654a4a9693dfa5552c022beb.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15156/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add chicken; reduce the heat to low, cover, and cook until chicken is no longer pink in the center and the juices run clear, 20 to 40 minutes. An instant-read thermometer inserted into the center should read at least 165 degrees F (74 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/jM5F8BX3_w6kY_-41Umdgz9n8vY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/15156-Easy-Chicken-Curry-ddmds-4x3-step-04-be9467103b8c4024813f153c2a6108c3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15156/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Uncover and cook, stirring constantly to prevent burning, until pan juices reduce to desired amount, 3 to 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/t4xAhdj-W47NKVwnNByHSfcQTn8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/15156-Easy-Chicken-Curry-ddmds-4x3-step-05-bb706facb1784ea6ad42a040e9a39aef.jpg"
